.TH std::mdspan::rank 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::mdspan::rank \- std::mdspan::rank

.SH Synopsis
static constexpr rank_type rank() noexcept;  (since C++23)

Returns the number of dimensions in a mdspan. Equivalent to return Extents::rank().

.SH Parameters

\fI(none)\fP

.SH Return value

The number of dimensions.

